  <item>
    <title>Ep.22 过去一年，你过得还好吗？新的一年，愿我们自如自在！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698ffaf2a22480add619e8fd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698ffaf2a22480add619e8fd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Feb 2026 04:37:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又一年过去啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢嘉宾和听众朋友们的支持！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 慢慢 和 宜生 在这一年有什么成长和收获呢？对未来又有什么期待呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们一起来听她们的故事~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间戳】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 播客2025总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">02:51</a> 宜生个人总结：做妈妈的身份转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 哪种思维有利于我当下的开心，我就按那种思维来想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">07:03</a> 慢慢个人总结：工作上更得心应手一些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">10:02</a> 作为大学老师，如何提高学生的积极性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a> 大学里什么比较重要：学习能力和态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="917">15:17</a> 怎么变得更自如？——经历，接受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 我比较期待的理解自己的状态是：当我情绪涌来的时候，我能迅速知道情绪背后到底是触碰到了我的哪个点，能迅速地把它安抚好或者疏解开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1201">20:01</a> 爱自己的表现就是我能更自如地和自己相处，我希望它能成为我的本能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">23:07</a> “自由”和“自如”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a> 希望大家少一些遗憾或后悔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1683">28:03</a> 录播客的感受：大家都会遇到一些情绪问题，但也正是这些情绪让我们在慢慢成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 读过的书、听过的故事不记得又怎样？当下的治愈是真的就可以了呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a> 对2026年播客的期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2431">40:31</a> 过去一年有什么在脑海中经常出现的想法吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2918">48:38</a> 祝大家新的一年自如自在！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>慢慢、宜生</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>慢慢、宜生</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>片头：新年好呀</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：Happy New Year</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/658913a21c86c12ed8c4b920/lve7O77mwneXDwSHDvJcYxmqAriE.m4a" length="48412852" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgFabOWo2TbxSur686D6Mf4BVpMQ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
